              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omulebe ofwisiisie lundi owimeleele kamasika, alarusia kumubili munju. Omulebe alareeba oyo osikaale munju ali, “Okundi alimo ku?” Omundu oyo alakobosia ali, “Tawe.” Abwenao omulebe alaloma ali, “Sila busa! Khukhakhola khurio khwararakho lisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
