              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi owe bunyali aloma ali, “Baisiraeli, ndaruma ekholo engeni khuamba sibala sienywe. Balamupia enywe siibi khukhwama khu silibwa sia Hamati khukhwola khu kheechi kha Araba.”",
          "type": "text",
